==============================================================================
Wonderland — Translation Chat MVP showcase (T36, full cast via Runner)
==============================================================================
Project root: /tmp/translation-chat
Budget cap:   $3.00
Timeout:      300s
Directive:    Build a translation-integrated chat application MVP. Two users in different language groups exchanging short messages with near-real-time translation. EU consumer scope (GDPR applies). Target: shippable v1 in three weeks. Initial scope: text-only messages, two-language pairs at launch (English ↔ German, English ↔ Japanese), no message edit, no message delete, basic auth. Looking for the team to scope, decompose, and identify the ship-blocking decisions.

